/E (The Online Food Delivery SQL Project analyzes customer ordering behavior, restaurant performance, menu pricing, and sales trends using MySQL. The project demonstrates advanced SQL concepts such as CASE statements, Common Table Expressions \(CTEs\), Window Functions, Temporary Tables, Views, Aggregate Functions, and Subqueries to solve real-world business problems. The objective is to extract meaningful insights that help restaurants improve customer experience, optimize menu offerings, and increase overall revenue.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
